        69,
        72,
        76
      ],
      "labels": {
        "69": "A (vi)",
        "72": "C",
        "76": "E"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "show",
      "title": "I and vi share two notes",
      "body": "C major is C E G and A minor is A C E. They share C and E, which is why they sit so well side by side.",
